# Line endings.
#
# Git already stores every text file with LF, and Prettier's default `endOfLine: "lf"` expects the
# same in the working tree. On Windows `core.autocrlf=true` converts them to CRLF on checkout, so
# `pnpm format:check` reported 26 files as unformatted when only their line endings differed —
# their content was already correct. Reformatting those files would have been a no-op diff that
# came back on the next checkout.
#
# `eol=lf` pins the working tree to LF on every platform, matching what is committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
